<description>&lt;p&gt;Intercommunal clashes in Rumbek have killed at least 71 people, prompting caretaker governor Rin Tueny to return to Lakes State. Two SSPDF soldiers were wounded in an attack on a Mundri West military outpost, and a U.S. Embassy condemnation followed an attack on WFP workers in Jonglei that involved looting of aid. A court in Juba sentenced five officers to 24 years for a raid on a general's home, and Pibor called on Jonglei authorities to return 81 abducted women and children. The lethal communal violence now far exceeds the two battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNajRneUIzNVQwRGtLeEtpSm9jOThWdFNWOEJqb0JaamxPQ2xtVUdWTExXQzZwbVllZ1c2UDhSWlg3Z2JxQlJ6blhrVXR3OEdPbzBvZTZWdXlZWmxFZEl0X3A4MVFqbEtTTlFnOG5XaWtWSUR2Rm5ibzNuQ0YwbGJBdU03SWFZdEhobHRKbGFxN3NnQ0cyWklxYkxiMkFiRUc1bllUcmV2S1diWGs?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Humanitarian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQbFdiNnNBUVRGTlN1X0tab0hKQUxZOUxLVk5Fb19RTGVMQkx2TkM2VkU0eFItYUhiNnlUSzRnZmc4dHdHZ1ZhVGlyM3dNTmIycEJ2RjZoYi0zRkFiUmFfczRETXpBMWFNQlBUZEFyal9ybGpiMTVxSWUwVWx4SUZiOS1Od0h4V1A5TWJLN3dDcGpiN2Z4RTIwZTFzczhITFF3YVI2Mnl0Znd6NW13Y0RUbXZWcVJVZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudans Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxNeG1NR0FaRXhzNnc5TWJKTEVRSUF1OWZaRkJVd2xJZjZibHBLY2VTOXdWTVdoWGRWOHo3S1V3ZjJkSmpfNkFCWmdPN0pIczQ4Z1pMT0NhVG1kMXlWMnBLZXQ3Q01nQTNudW5mc2w4dlNCWnJuTGgxX2dPdzhJY200MlpwMGVOaFZ0YjhfZ0VXQ1RnMDBvWlVtLUFXMWhjdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Peoples Gazette Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.goo